        {
          "id": 465557960,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "In particular, those lines are generated from lines in epan/dissectors/asn1/snmp/snmp.cnf; *those* lines should be changed, and then the \"asn1\" target should be built in the build directory, to re-generate the dissectors for ASN.1-defined protocols, including the SNMP dissector.\n\nAt that point, there will be two modified files, both of which should be submitted in the change - epan/dissectors/asn1/snmp/snmp.cnf and epan/dissectors/packet-snmp.c.",
